OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'scared to leave homes',
OL,4,Acouncil hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are afraid to leave their
OL,7,Fhomes as anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Fcontinues to blight the area, a council
OL,9,Fmeeting has heard.
OL,11,FReform UK presented a motion to
OL,12,FNewcastle City Council saying people in
OL,13,FBlakelaw and Cowgate were facing
OL,14,F"serious harm", with fires being set,
OL,15,Femergency workers attacked and buses
OL,16,Fbeing withdrawn at night.
OL,18,FHowever, a Green Party amendment
OL,19,Fwidening the scope of the motion to
OL,20,Finclude the entire city was passed
OL,21,Funanimously.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
